# Vendored external deps -- not worth bloating the repo with full C
# source trees + prebuilt libs. Reproducible from docs/mgba-setup.md and
# docs/melonds-setup.md, which pin the upstream tag and the exact
# configure flags. melonDS is *not* used unmodified: our changes to it
# are versioned as patches/melonds/*.patch, applied on top of that tag
# -- so anything edited under third_party/melonds/src/ has to be folded
# back into that patch or it is lost with this directory.
/third_party/

# RomHack Hub admin bearer token for publishing the app listing -- never commit.
/.secrets/
